00:00:29.153 --> 00:00:32.021
WHAT ABOUT THE ACTUAL CRIME

00:00:32.022 --> 00:00:32.956
COMMITTED SINCE SMOLLETT MADE

00:00:32.957 --> 00:00:33.890
HIS CLAIM?

00:00:33.891 --> 00:00:35.291
THESE ARE THE STATS THE POLICE

00:00:35.292 --> 00:00:36.092
SHARED WITH US TODAY.

00:00:36.093 --> 00:00:38.995
FROM GENERA 28, THE DAY BEFORE

00:00:38.996 --> 00:00:40.563
THE ALLEGED SMOLLETT INCIDENT,

00:00:40.564 --> 00:00:43.032
THROUGH FIBER 17TH, CHICAGO

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:45.001
REPORTED 22 MURDERS, 134

00:00:45.002 --> 00:00:45.735
INSTANCES OF CRIMINAL

00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:47.837
SEXUAL ASSAULT, THREADED 42

00:00:47.838 --> 00:00:50.473
ROBBERIES, 88 INSTANCES OF

00:00:50.474 --> 00:00:53.610
AGGRAVATED BATTERY.

00:00:53.611 --> 00:00:54.811
WHAT ABOUT THE BACKLOG OF

00:00:54.812 --> 00:00:56.279
UNSOLVED MURDERS IN THE CITY?

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.948
BACK IN 2000, THE CITY SOUGHT

00:00:58.949 --> 00:00:59.649
41% OF MURDERS THAT OCCURRED

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:01.618
THAT YEAR.

00:01:01.619 --> 00:01:02.719
IN 2009, ONLY 30% OF MURDERS

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:06.055
WERE SOLVED.

00:01:06.056 --> 00:01:07.524
BY 2017, JUST A 17% OF MURDERS

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:09.726
WERE SOLVED.

00:01:09.727 --> 00:01:11.628
THEY HAVE TO FOCUS ALL OF THEIR

00:01:11.629 --> 00:01:12.428
RESOURCES ON FIXING THAT.

00:01:12.429 --> 00:01:15.231
JOINING US NOW IS SOMEONE WITH

00:01:15.232 --> 00:01:17.634
INTIMATE KNOWLEDGE OF THAT

00:01:17.635 --> 00:01:19.102
FORCE, FORMER CHICAGO OFFICER

00:01:19.103 --> 00:01:19.569
DIMITRI ROBERTS.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:21.271
