00:01:23.007 --> 00:01:24.507
THINK, NOW, WITH EVERYTHING THAT

00:01:24.508 --> 00:01:25.642
HAS HAPPENED?

00:01:25.643 --> 00:01:26.709
ALL THE MAN-HOURS TAKEN AWAY?

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:28.978
&gt;&gt; I CAN TELL YOU, SOMEONE WHO

00:01:28.979 --> 00:01:30.647
IS BENT ON THE STREETS MANY A

00:01:30.648 --> 00:01:32.182
NIGHT AND WORKED SIMILAR CASES,

00:01:32.183 --> 00:01:32.916
IT IS FRUSTRATING WHEN YOU HAVE

00:01:32.917 --> 00:01:36.186
A SITUATION LIKE THIS WHERE, AT

00:01:36.187 --> 00:01:37.187
A MINIMUM, YOU WOULD EXPECT THE

00:01:37.188 --> 00:01:40.223
VICTIM TO COOPERATE FULLY AND

00:01:40.224 --> 00:01:41.991
