00:01:44.061 --> 00:01:44.827
MEDIA ATTENTION.

00:01:44.828 --> 00:01:47.230
AND THAT IS JUST NOT HAPPENING.

00:01:47.231 --> 00:01:48.932
THE OFFICERS I'VE SPOKE WITH ARE

00:01:48.933 --> 00:01:49.866
EXTREMELY FRUSTRATED WITH WHAT

00:01:49.867 --> 00:01:51.467
IS GOING ON, BUT MORE SO AS WE

00:01:51.468 --> 00:01:54.337
TALK ABOUT ON SEVERAL OCCASIONS,

00:01:54.338 --> 00:01:55.805
IT IS TAKING CRITICAL RESOURCES

00:01:55.806 --> 00:01:56.639
OFF THE STREETS.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:57.740
&gt;&gt; Laura: WE ARE TOLD HE IS

00:01:57.741 --> 00:01:59.475
NOT COOPERATING WITH POLICE.

00:01:59.476 --> 00:02:01.444
